{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05424","headline":"奉和御制平胡 · 韩休","name":"奉和御制平胡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南牧正纷纷，长河起塞氛。\n玉符徵选士，金钺拜将军。\n叠鼓摇边吹，连旌暗朔云。\n祆星乘夜落，害气入朝分。\n始见幽烽警，俄看烈火焚。\n功成奏凯乐，战罢策归勳。\n盛德陈清庙，神谟属大君。\n叨荣逢偃羽，率舞咏时文。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05424.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05424","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}